--- !u!114 &446597466
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 446597464}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 96d9554a4e8d466428532d5eaf4813b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MetaMove.Demo.Kitting.ShiftReport
  cell: {fileID: 1796869840}
  speed: {fileID: 867426346}
  font: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f675742eaf9c20a4f909d78ee7a14fed, type: 2}
  lines:
  - key: report_intro
    title: 
    caption: Here is how the cell worked with you.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6210554aab7d94046882aab9d0f0370b, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_far
    title: 
    caption: You gave the arm plenty of room, so it could work at full speed the
      whole time.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7387ad6204c75ea4cb2846b59babb6ae, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_slowed
    title: 
    caption: Whenever you came closer, the arm slowed down for you, and picked up
      speed again as you stepped back. That is the safety layer at work.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 321ff956c52f84a49b91634be8a783cd, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_stopped
    title: 
    caption: At one point you came close enough for the arm to stop, and it waited
      until you stepped back.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7120b9ca8314bac4aa98ba5c9de18619, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_pinch_exact
    title: 
    caption: You showed it the spot almost exactly. The robot only fine-tuned the
      last few millimetres.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab68d859aad9f8a4f8c0c3576fd55728, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_pinch_close
    title: 
    caption: 'You showed it roughly where, and the robot worked out the last few
      centimetres. That is the whole idea: you point, it does the precise part.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e5b85403677c79440a4917c4fa619300, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_pinch_rough
    title: 
    caption: You showed it the general direction, and the robot found the exact spot
      on its own. Roughly is all it needs.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 971ea21fd34d7f248a23a3ed3072d4e6, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_teach_slow
    title: 
    caption: No rush on the teaching. It's not every day a factory grows out of the
      floor.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 969b7c9b82e40b94bb4805c6b5faa5bf, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_teach_fast
    title: 
    caption: And it learned the new position in no time.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f56f93ce073fb8d43b94cd4a8d2ec299, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_outro
    title: 
    caption: 'In short: the line kept running, you were safe the whole time, and
      you just did in a minute what used to need an engineer: you taught a robot,
      without a single line of code. If you like, open Freestyle in the hand menu:
      let the line run on its own, or teach the robot any box you like.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b026459082aab94d947af60636c0df8, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  - key: report_outro_expert
    title: 
    caption: Same task, second time. Next to each number you see your first run.
      Whatever came easier now, that is what you learned.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: caecd0f44fe14f2409ba9dba21314bbb, type: 3}
    hold: 0
  pinchExact: 0.03
  pinchRough: 0.08
  teachSlow: 25
  showDelay: 14
  showDelayExpert: 3
  storyVoice: {fileID: 1796869836}
